+def load_errata(repo: Path) -> tuple[list[dict], str | None]:
+    """Round-47 C3: pinned errata for recorded governance absences.
+
+    Absence of the file means zero errata (the gate keeps its old fail-closed
+    behaviour). A present-but-unreadable/malformed registry is an ERROR, never
+    a silent skip: the only way to excuse a dead token is a valid entry.
